  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童户外拼搭帐篷套装（夜光款不含布）",
    "en": "Kids Outdoor Fort Building Set (Glow Version, No Fabric)"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向户外与活动场景的儿童拼搭帐篷套装，支持杆件与连接件拼接成游戏空间，适合家庭互动、园区活动和课堂拓展使用。\n\n产品为无品牌供货，定位儿童玩具，产地东莞茶山，支持多件组合采购与常规渠道上架。",
    "en": "This is a kids outdoor fort building set designed for activity-oriented play scenarios. It uses rods and connectors to build a playable structure for family interaction, kids events, and classroom extensions.\n\nThe product is supplied as a non-branded item in the children’s toy category, made in Chashan, Dongguan, and suitable for bundled procurement and standard channel listing."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童户外拼搭帐篷套装适用于临时游戏空间搭建，可通过组件拼接形成开放式活动区域，方便在庭院、露营场景和互动课堂中使用。",
      "产品主打可拼接与可重构玩法，支持多次拆装。夜光款（不含布）更适合做氛围玩法扩展，兼顾趣味展示和互动体验。",
      "该商品采用彩盒包装，属于儿童玩具类目，适合无品牌渠道选品、电商上架与活动项目配套采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids outdoor fort set is suitable for creating temporary play spaces. Components can be connected into open structures for use in yards, camping scenarios, and interactive classroom activities.",
      "The product focuses on connectable and reconfigurable play, supporting repeated assembly. The glow-version concept (without fabric) is suitable for atmosphere-oriented play extensions and display impact.",
      "Packed in a color box, the item belongs to the children’s toy category and fits non-branded channel sourcing, e-commerce listing, and event project procurement."
    ]
  },
